(177005, 10013, 4625, '<td valign="top">cut out hand pics? looks reallly neat. The orange juice bottle (is that orange juice?) looks a bit too grainy it''s quality seems lower than that of the flower, also seems out of place I find myself wondering why a flower is growing in orange juice instead of wondering why hands are growing out of a flower. Cute concept, but the shot could have been touched up just a bit.</td>', 'cut out hand pics? looks reallly neat. The orange juice bottle (is that orange juice?) looks a bit too grainy it''s quality seems lower than that of the flower, also seems out of place I find myself wondering why a flower is growing in orange juice instead of wondering why hands are growing out of a flower. Cute concept, but the shot could have been touched up just a bit.', '2002-12-23 13:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(177007, 9893, 4625, '<td valign="top">The title of this shot makes me like it even more. I like the soft feel in this picture, I like the short depth of field, I like the background, I like the cropping. Overall I like this picture! Well done :)</td>', 'The title of this shot makes me like it even more. I like the soft feel in this picture, I like the short depth of field, I like the background, I like the cropping. Overall I like this picture! Well done :)', '2002-12-23 13:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
