(177021, 10035, 4625, '<td valign="top">That''s a lazy day! This one is done well, in that the arm stays the main point of focus even though there''s a lot of other stuff in this shot. Everything else sets the mood of the arm, and the arm tells a story about the person in the tub with their arm stretched out. The shot is done well in terms of layout, but it seems to be lacking in quality. it looks really grainy, which is sad because it would be a really nice shot otherwise.</td>', 'That''s a lazy day! This one is done well, in that the arm stays the main point of focus even though there''s a lot of other stuff in this shot. Everything else sets the mood of the arm, and the arm tells a story about the person in the tub with their arm stretched out. The shot is done well in terms of layout, but it seems to be lacking in quality. it looks really grainy, which is sad because it would be a really nice shot otherwise.', '2002-12-23 13:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(177022, 9977, 4625, '<td valign="top">This one seems to draw my eye more toward the cue ball than the hand, even though the hand is more in focus. I don''t know if it''s because the cue points at the cue ball, or because of the angles that sorta move my eye toward the cue ball. Or maybe the lighting. Other than the distraction of the cue ball from what should be the main subect in the shot (the hand.) This shot is done well.</td>', 'This one seems to draw my eye more toward the cue ball than the hand, even though the hand is more in focus. I don''t know if it''s because the cue points at the cue ball, or because of the angles that sorta move my eye toward the cue ball. Or maybe the lighting. Other than the distraction of the cue ball from what should be the main subect in the shot (the hand.) This shot is done well.', '2002-12-23 13:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(177023, 10068, 4625, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a blurred, and hte lighting on the eye seems to cause a lot of loss in detail.</td>', 'The focus seems a blurred, and hte lighting on the eye seems to cause a lot of loss in detail.', '2002-12-23 13:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
