(177026, 9989, 4625, '<td valign="top">Too blurred. Try using more light, and moving the camera back a bit further. Or if you can set the camera to take the picture on a higher quality, and/or higher resolution that would help a great deal.</td>', 'Too blurred. Try using more light, and moving the camera back a bit further. Or if you can set the camera to take the picture on a higher quality, and/or higher resolution that would help a great deal.', '2002-12-23 13:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(177029, 9967, 4625, '<td valign="top">Nice use of lighting to show the foot. I like the shot, but it''s too blurred. the crop is nice, and hte idea is great. Just wish it was in focus.</td>', 'Nice use of lighting to show the foot. I like the shot, but it''s too blurred. the crop is nice, and hte idea is great. Just wish it was in focus.', '2002-12-23 13:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(177031, 9893, 573, '<td valign="top">Nice compositional lines, technicaly good and fits in the challenge theme.</td>', 'Nice compositional lines, technicaly good and fits in the challenge theme.', '2002-12-23 13:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(177032, 10012, 4625, '<td valign="top">The background being blue seems to take away from the eye being blue. If all the colors except blue were taken out of hte picture leaving the face black and white (which it seems) then the background is definately too distracting. It''s hard to tell that the face is black and white, my eye sees a lot of color and sort of assumes the face should be colored too. a different background would make this shot better.</td>', 'The background being blue seems to take away from the eye being blue. If all the colors except blue were taken out of hte picture leaving the face black and white (which it seems) then the background is definately too distracting. It''s hard to tell that the face is black and white, my eye sees a lot of color and sort of assumes the face should be colored too. a different background would make this shot better.', '2002-12-23 13:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(177033, 9982, 4625, '<td valign="top">Flawless, the first ten I''ve given out. Excellent job, not a flaw on the picture. Everything fits perfectly. Great job! :)</td>', 'Flawless, the first ten I''ve given out. Excellent job, not a flaw on the picture. Everything fits perfectly. Great job! :)', '2002-12-23 13:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(177034, 10009, 4625, '<td valign="top">Nicely done shot. I like the tone of the picture it''s very fitting. The hands are in great detail and tell a story wonderfully. Well done!</td>', 'Nicely done shot. I like the tone of the picture it''s very fitting. The hands are in great detail and tell a story wonderfully. Well done!', '2002-12-23 13:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(177035, 10066, 4625, '<td valign="top">I like the soft feel of this picture it''s veryt fitting. The lighting is done really well. Overall the shot is really nice. Good job :)</td>', 'I like the soft feel of this picture it''s veryt fitting. The lighting is done really well. Overall the shot is really nice. Good job :)', '2002-12-23 13:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(177036, 9911, 4625, '<td valign="top">I like the pose, I like the lighting, but the contrast is a bit harsh. If the contrast was a bit softer I think it would look a bit better. I really like the crop everything is positioned really well. Good job :)</td>', 'I like the pose, I like the lighting, but the contrast is a bit harsh. If the contrast was a bit softer I think it would look a bit better. I really like the crop everything is positioned really well. Good job :)', '2002-12-23 13:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(177037, 9869, 4625, '<td valign="top">nice shot, I like the pose, and the cropping. I wish it was in focus though, that takes away so much from the shot.</td>', 'nice shot, I like the pose, and the cropping. I wish it was in focus though, that takes away so much from the shot.', '2002-12-23 13:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(177038, 10082, 4625, '<td valign="top">I love the detail in the facial hair. I don''t so much care for the tongue though. I like how in the background you can make out the necklace.</td>', 'I love the detail in the facial hair. I don''t so much care for the tongue though. I like how in the background you can make out the necklace.', '2002-12-23 13:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(177041, 10007, 573, '<td valign="top">The concept is great but attention to the details needs some work.  ie:  pubic hair sticking up, fingernails need work and underware''s elastic band impression is visible.</td>', 'The concept is great but attention to the details needs some work.  ie:  pubic hair sticking up, fingernails need work and underware''s elastic band impression is visible.', '2002-12-23 13:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(177045, 9982, 2178, '<td valign="top">I love this picture, great idea, nicely executed. Sorry I cant vote, woulda been a 10.</td>', 'I love this picture, great idea, nicely executed. Sorry I cant vote, woulda been a 10.', '2002-12-23 13:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(177051, 10040, 573, '<td valign="top">Good composition, IR ilumination in the camera solves the macro lighting problem.  Just does not grab me other than an interesting technique.</td>', 'Good composition, IR ilumination in the camera solves the macro lighting problem.  Just does not grab me other than an interesting technique.', '2002-12-23 13:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(177054, 9911, 573, '<td valign="top">Moody technique well done.</td>', 'Moody technique well done.', '2002-12-23 14:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(177057, 10070, 573, '<td valign="top">Good concept but the lighting is too harsh in my opinion.</td>', 'Good concept but the lighting is too harsh in my opinion.', '2002-12-23 14:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(177065, 10005, 4411, '<td valign="top">Focus and lighting are fairly good, but the image overall is pretty nondesript. It''s just not a particularly appealing composition to these eyes I''m afraid.</td>', 'Focus and lighting are fairly good, but the image overall is pretty nondesript. It''s just not a particularly appealing composition to these eyes I''m afraid.', '2002-12-23 14:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(177084, 9914, 4648, '<td valign="top">That is an awesome grip.  Great shot.  I love it.  The focus is so crisp and poignant. The colors are great.  This is an awesome 10 in my book.  PTL</td>', 'That is an awesome grip.  Great shot.  I love it.  The focus is so crisp and poignant. The colors are great.  This is an awesome 10 in my book.  PTL', '2002-12-23 15:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(177085, 10040, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is wild.  The coloring makes it, as much as I hate to say that.  There''s another in B&amp;W that actually helps this one, by contrasting the difference.  Lucky for you.  Yes, the eyes are th window to the soul and this one speaks volumns.  Great job.  PTL  It''s a 10 as far as I''m concerned.</td>', 'This is wild.  The coloring makes it, as much as I hate to say that.  There''s another in B&W that actually helps this one, by contrasting the difference.  Lucky for you.  Yes, the eyes are th window to the soul and this one speaks volumns.  Great job.  PTL  It''s a 10 as far as I''m concerned.', '2002-12-23 15:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(177087, 10068, 4648, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite grasp what it is about this picture that bothers me.  Maybe the white dot in the eye.  I have not been able to over come that either, so I can''t help you there.  Maybe if you had been higher above the eye, even crop with the bottom, you could seen into, so to speak, the eye.  The pupil seems to stop your vision dead.  Technically it is good, but and it''s hard to explain the but.  The only way I can explain it is...it''s a dead photo.  Hope you can understand.  PTL</td>', 'I can''t quite grasp what it is about this picture that bothers me.  Maybe the white dot in the eye.  I have not been able to over come that either, so I can''t help you there.  Maybe if you had been higher above the eye, even crop with the bottom, you could seen into, so to speak, the eye.  The pupil seems to stop your vision dead.  Technically it is good, but and it''s hard to explain the but.  The only way I can explain it is...it''s a dead photo.  Hope you can understand.  PTL', '2002-12-23 15:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(177091, 10038, 4648, '<td valign="top">OMG!  Is this ever a beautiful eye.  The color and detail is so wild.  Am I imagining or is that a star on the left side of the color.  You can''t get any better than this.  I stand in awe. 10, 10, 10.  OMG!  PTL</td>', 'OMG!  Is this ever a beautiful eye.  The color and detail is so wild.  Am I imagining or is that a star on the left side of the color.  You can''t get any better than this.  I stand in awe. 10, 10, 10.  OMG!  PTL', '2002-12-23 15:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(177093, 10072, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is so cute.  I had to laugh when I read the title.  Thanks for the laugh.  This is great.  Not a wonderfully good technical photo, but funny.  I''d give it a 10 for how much laugh I got out of it.  God bless your humor.  PTL</td>', 'This is so cute.  I had to laugh when I read the title.  Thanks for the laugh.  This is great.  Not a wonderfully good technical photo, but funny.  I''d give it a 10 for how much laugh I got out of it.  God bless your humor.  PTL', '2002-12-23 15:47:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(177096, 9941, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love the reflection of the eye lashes in the eye itself.  This definitely speaks fear.  The detail in the eye is unreal.  I wish it had been just a little lighter.  I find myself struggling to look at the color of the eyes and into it.  But it is an awesome 10.  PTL</td>', 'I love the reflection of the eye lashes in the eye itself.  This definitely speaks fear.  The detail in the eye is unreal.  I wish it had been just a little lighter.  I find myself struggling to look at the color of the eyes and into it.  But it is an awesome 10.  PTL', '2002-12-23 15:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(177098, 10009, 4648, '<td valign="top">I like the color of this but it would have been better in the natural.  The dirt on the hands would look more realistic, and that is a good addition to the photo.  I really like the close crop.  Good clear focus, able to see the fingerprints well.  Good job and at least an 8 in my book.  PTL</td>', 'I like the color of this but it would have been better in the natural.  The dirt on the hands would look more realistic, and that is a good addition to the photo.  I really like the close crop.  Good clear focus, able to see the fingerprints well.  Good job and at least an 8 in my book.  PTL', '2002-12-23 15:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(177103, 10024, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is adorable.  Great lighting, good composition.  Really beautiful.  I don''t care much for the brown border, but to me this is still a solid 10!  Nice job, and good luck!</td>', 'This is adorable.  Great lighting, good composition.  Really beautiful.  I don''t care much for the brown border, but to me this is still a solid 10!  Nice job, and good luck!', '2002-12-23 16:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(177107, 10066, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, great use of lighting etc.  Only thing that subtracts from the photo is the fact that it looks like there is some dust or something on your background.  Otherwise this is a very touching scene.  Nice job!  -9-</td>', 'This is lovely, great use of lighting etc.  Only thing that subtracts from the photo is the fact that it looks like there is some dust or something on your background.  Otherwise this is a very touching scene.  Nice job!  -9-', '2002-12-23 16:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(177108, 9982, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is so cute!  I really like this photo.  The only thing that bothers me is it looks lightly grainy.  It really is a great photo though!  I love the composition and the added hand and placement of the eyes really makes this photo!  Great job, good luck!  -9-</td>', 'This is so cute!  I really like this photo.  The only thing that bothers me is it looks lightly grainy.  It really is a great photo though!  I love the composition and the added hand and placement of the eyes really makes this photo!  Great job, good luck!  -9-', '2002-12-23 16:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(177110, 10061, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo, I like the coloring you used for it, very soft and nice.  I love the way that the shirt just peeks in from the top, and the jeweled belly button is very modern!  Only thing I don''t care for is the lighting.  The dark rightside bothers me, and detracts from the photo somewhat.  -8-</td>', 'This is a great photo, I like the coloring you used for it, very soft and nice.  I love the way that the shirt just peeks in from the top, and the jeweled belly button is very modern!  Only thing I don''t care for is the lighting.  The dark rightside bothers me, and detracts from the photo somewhat.  -8-', '2002-12-23 16:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(177111, 10007, 4967, '<td valign="top">Tantalizing!  This is a very interesting photo!  I love the direction the hands take, almost like a heart shape, and the confomity of the picture is really nice.  The focus looks slightly sharper on the body then on the hands which is sort of distracting, but otherwise great job!  -8-</td>', 'Tantalizing!  This is a very interesting photo!  I love the direction the hands take, almost like a heart shape, and the confomity of the picture is really nice.  The focus looks slightly sharper on the body then on the hands which is sort of distracting, but otherwise great job!  -8-', '2002-12-23 16:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(177118, 9933, 3087, '<td valign="top">Hello Gordon - this is nice... though you look somewhat uncomfortable!  Where are you looking? It seems off to the side?</td>', 'Hello Gordon - this is nice... though you look somewhat uncomfortable!  Where are you looking? It seems off to the side?', '2002-12-23 16:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(177186, 10081, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great black and white.. i love the dramatic lighting, but i think the lighting on the subject is just a touch on the weak side... = 8 - setzler</td>', 'I think this is a great black and white.. i love the dramatic lighting, but i think the lighting on the subject is just a touch on the weak side... = 8 - setzler', '2002-12-23 16:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(177204, 10035, 4055, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours. Well done composition and focus is good. Perhaps the arm is a little too centered in the photo. A little bit to the left could probably have done it. Perhaps this couldn´t be done because of other things at right. Overall a very nice photo. Good luck!</td>', 'Lovely colours. Well done composition and focus is good. Perhaps the arm is a little too centered in the photo. A little bit to the left could probably have done it. Perhaps this couldn´t be done because of other things at right. Overall a very nice photo. Good luck!', '2002-12-23 17:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(177207, 9967, 4055, '<td valign="top">I like your photo very much. I was planning this too but with my hand and a red colour. You have manage very well. Good lighting and the "out of focus" doesn´t bother me at all. Good Luck!</td>', 'I like your photo very much. I was planning this too but with my hand and a red colour. You have manage very well. Good lighting and the "out of focus" doesn´t bother me at all. Good Luck!', '2002-12-23 17:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(177210, 10007, 4055, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo. Nice in sepia tone and the lighting is good. So is the focus. I also like your composition. Well done. Good luck!</td>', 'This is a good photo. Nice in sepia tone and the lighting is good. So is the focus. I also like your composition. Well done. Good luck!', '2002-12-23 17:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(177211, 9997, 4055, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and focus. Very interesting. Perfect in b&amp;w. Well done. Good Luck!</td>', 'Excellent lighting and focus. Very interesting. Perfect in b&w. Well done. Good Luck!', '2002-12-23 17:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(177213, 9834, 4055, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Perfect in b&amp;w. Good lighting and focus. I also like the cropping but I´m not so fond of the blue border. I had probably got a grey colour from a foot and placed it in the border. Overall a very well done work.</td>', 'Nice photo. Perfect in b&w. Good lighting and focus. I also like the cropping but I´m not so fond of the blue border. I had probably got a grey colour from a foot and placed it in the border. Overall a very well done work.', '2002-12-23 17:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(177238, 9941, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice clean, clear, crisp shot. Really well done. I''m tempted to say I don''t like the light but it works here. I like it.</td>', 'Nice clean, clear, crisp shot. Really well done. I''m tempted to say I don''t like the light but it works here. I like it.', '2002-12-23 18:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
