(177240, 9950, 327, '<td valign="top">I like your composition, and the tones. The focus is terrible........but you know I think it''s your compression. If I''m wrong correct me, but the software you used has hurt this neat shot. Still I give you a 7 it''s good work.</td>', 'I like your composition, and the tones. The focus is terrible........but you know I think it''s your compression. If I''m wrong correct me, but the software you used has hurt this neat shot. Still I give you a 7 it''s good work.', '2002-12-23 18:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
