(177291, 10066, 4411, '<td valign="top">A very nice image. Nice gentle pose, good lighting and colour. Well done.</td>', 'A very nice image. Nice gentle pose, good lighting and colour. Well done.', '2002-12-23 20:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(177292, 10012, 4411, '<td valign="top">I find the background too distracting, it overpowers the image too much. The focal point should be the blue eyes, but they are hidden.<br/>I do like the composition though, and the contrast between the face and the background is very strong.</td>', 'I find the background too distracting, it overpowers the image too much. The focal point should be the blue eyes, but they are hidden.I do like the composition though, and the contrast between the face and the background is very strong.', '2002-12-23 20:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(177295, 10024, 4411, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is too strong for me<br/>The idea is good and the title very humourous. Maybe a black &amp; white or sepia version would tone down the harsh light and make this a better shot?</td>', 'The lighting on this is too strong for meThe idea is good and the title very humourous. Maybe a black & white or sepia version would tone down the harsh light and make this a better shot?', '2002-12-23 20:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
