(177400, 9827, 4967, '<td valign="top">I''m really not sure what you were going for here... I''m guessing you got quite a few of these as comments.  Judging by the title, the best I can guess is that this is a picture of a scab, but I highly doubt it.  Sorry, but seeing as how I can''t tell what I''m looking at.  It''s not a very pleasing view, there is no point of focus, and the corners are fairly blurry I have to give this a low rating.  Email me if you want and let me know what this is.  Thanks!</td>', 'I''m really not sure what you were going for here... I''m guessing you got quite a few of these as comments.  Judging by the title, the best I can guess is that this is a picture of a scab, but I highly doubt it.  Sorry, but seeing as how I can''t tell what I''m looking at.  It''s not a very pleasing view, there is no point of focus, and the corners are fairly blurry I have to give this a low rating.  Email me if you want and let me know what this is.  Thanks!', '2002-12-23 23:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
