(178067, 9982, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2002-12-25 15:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(178069, 10070, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think this would be a bit better had the entire background been the dark cloth being held by the left arm.  I think that the closet doors do nothing for this shot.  The bright light from the left also is a bit too bright in my opinion.  It almost washes out the decoration (painting?)  on the nipple.  The curvature against the black cloth is good, I like that, and the angle and framing/cropping is also good.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think this would be a bit better had the entire background been the dark cloth being held by the left arm.  I think that the closet doors do nothing for this shot.  The bright light from the left also is a bit too bright in my opinion.  It almost washes out the decoration (painting?)  on the nipple.  The curvature against the black cloth is good, I like that, and the angle and framing/cropping is also good.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-25 15:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(178070, 9919, 3080, '<td valign="top">Kind of looks like a calvin klein ad. lol.  Definately a body part.  The background is good and the focus and clarity are good as well.  I think that lighting works very well.  I"m not so sure about the uncomfortable positioning of the left hand.  Looks a bit odd there.  Otherwise a nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Kind of looks like a calvin klein ad. lol.  Definately a body part.  The background is good and the focus and clarity are good as well.  I think that lighting works very well.  I"m not so sure about the uncomfortable positioning of the left hand.  Looks a bit odd there.  Otherwise a nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-25 15:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(178093, 9962, 1829, '<td valign="top">I really like the colour and soft tones.  Very nice shot.  Well done.</td>', 'I really like the colour and soft tones.  Very nice shot.  Well done.', '2002-12-25 18:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
