(178097, 10012, 1829, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  IMHO the blue netting really distracts the eye taking the focus off the child.  The child however is in focus and is a great b&amp;w.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  IMHO the blue netting really distracts the eye taking the focus off the child.  The child however is in focus and is a great b&w.', '2002-12-25 19:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(178111, 9893, 3080, '<td valign="top">I really like the soft focus on this.  I think it creates a mood.  The angle and framing/cropping are nice, and I think that the lighting is very good as well.  I wish that somehow it were possible to get the bottom half blackened out as well.  Although I''m not totally sure about that.  With the brown area, it gives it quite a bit of depth, and if it were blackened, that depth might not be there, so I''d have to see it to compare.  Otherwise, a very nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I really like the soft focus on this.  I think it creates a mood.  The angle and framing/cropping are nice, and I think that the lighting is very good as well.  I wish that somehow it were possible to get the bottom half blackened out as well.  Although I''m not totally sure about that.  With the brown area, it gives it quite a bit of depth, and if it were blackened, that depth might not be there, so I''d have to see it to compare.  Otherwise, a very nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-25 20:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(178112, 9911, 3080, '<td valign="top">Excelent shot. Great use of exaggerated lighting/shadows.  I think that the lighting on the fingers of the left hand (our left) is just a small bit too bright, however, lighting on the rest of the photo is great.  Focus and clarity are wonderful.  Definately an emotive piece.  Angle and framig/cropping really help the mood here.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Excelent shot. Great use of exaggerated lighting/shadows.  I think that the lighting on the fingers of the left hand (our left) is just a small bit too bright, however, lighting on the rest of the photo is great.  Focus and clarity are wonderful.  Definately an emotive piece.  Angle and framig/cropping really help the mood here.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-25 20:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(178118, 10024, 3080, '<td valign="top">Lighting looks a bit harsh on the feet.  I like the angle on the feet.  focus seems good to me, and I like how the feet are all ''posed'' the same.  I tried cropping this right above the green blanket, and I liked the result.  kind of a panorama style shot looked good with the line up of feet.  I like how the border matches the colors in the shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Lighting looks a bit harsh on the feet.  I like the angle on the feet.  focus seems good to me, and I like how the feet are all ''posed'' the same.  I tried cropping this right above the green blanket, and I liked the result.  kind of a panorama style shot looked good with the line up of feet.  I like how the border matches the colors in the shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-25 21:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(178119, 9982, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen here.  The addition of the hand is a nice touch.  Kind of brings the whole photo together.  The focus is a tad soft on the eyes, but it''s still a nice concept.  I like how this was done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen here.  The addition of the hand is a nice touch.  Kind of brings the whole photo together.  The focus is a tad soft on the eyes, but it''s still a nice concept.  I like how this was done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-25 21:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
