(178133, 10040, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good time to use soft-focus or blur effect.</td>', 'Good time to use soft-focus or blur effect.', '2002-12-25 22:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(178135, 9894, 332, '<td valign="top">Good composition. I would like to see more contrast between black and white. The border works good here. Good job!</td>', 'Good composition. I would like to see more contrast between black and white. The border works good here. Good job!', '2002-12-25 23:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(178136, 10007, 332, '<td valign="top">Good compositon. I would like to see this one with the apple red.</td>', 'Good compositon. I would like to see this one with the apple red.', '2002-12-25 23:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(178137, 10066, 332, '<td valign="top">Needs more contrast.</td>', 'Needs more contrast.', '2002-12-25 23:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(178138, 9834, 332, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the border. White border... or just none would have worked better. That''s what I think. Good picture though.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the border. White border... or just none would have worked better. That''s what I think. Good picture though.', '2002-12-25 23:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(178139, 9933, 332, '<td valign="top">I think it needs to be sharper. Great idea and good contrast.</td>', 'I think it needs to be sharper. Great idea and good contrast.', '2002-12-25 23:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(178140, 9890, 332, '<td valign="top">Great composition!</td>', 'Great composition!', '2002-12-25 23:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(178153, 9893, 332, '<td valign="top">The softness of this image is wonderful. Good job.</td>', 'The softness of this image is wonderful. Good job.', '2002-12-25 23:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(178162, 9933, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like it.  I especially like how the hair doesn''t blend into the background all the way, you have made it so that you can tell the difference between the hair and the background, which I''m sure is a difficult task with a shot like this.  Would make a great black and white portrait too.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like it.  I especially like how the hair doesn''t blend into the background all the way, you have made it so that you can tell the difference between the hair and the background, which I''m sure is a difficult task with a shot like this.  Would make a great black and white portrait too.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-26 00:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(178164, 9880, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice intimate shot...sultry and sensual. Skin tones even and realistic with beautiful complexion.  I''m bothered a little by the lips, however. First, I see multi-colored small dots in both upper and lower lips.  Secondly, outline of lipstick on lower lip could have been cleaned up a little before the shot. And finally, I think that the picture was cropped too closely to the woman''s left side of her mouth.  All in all, if I were voting, I would give the pic a 9, cause I really do want to kiss her!</td>', 'Nice intimate shot...sultry and sensual. Skin tones even and realistic with beautiful complexion.  I''m bothered a little by the lips, however. First, I see multi-colored small dots in both upper and lower lips.  Secondly, outline of lipstick on lower lip could have been cleaned up a little before the shot. And finally, I think that the picture was cropped too closely to the woman''s left side of her mouth.  All in all, if I were voting, I would give the pic a 9, cause I really do want to kiss her!', '2002-12-26 00:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(178190, 9933, 1829, '<td valign="top">A very creative shot.  I like the hands around the face, it adds interest and it actually looks like you are holding your head.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'A very creative shot.  I like the hands around the face, it adds interest and it actually looks like you are holding your head.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2002-12-26 06:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(178191, 9880, 1829, '<td valign="top">Great rich colour in the lips, however the corner of the lip is cut out of the picture.  Overall a great shot.  Well done.</td>', 'Great rich colour in the lips, however the corner of the lip is cut out of the picture.  Overall a great shot.  Well done.', '2002-12-26 06:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(178200, 10081, 3127, '<td valign="top">I like the strength of this image, but it is a little too dark. Great photo, though!</td>', 'I like the strength of this image, but it is a little too dark. Great photo, though!', '2002-12-26 08:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(178201, 9941, 3127, '<td valign="top">Good expression and wonderful clarity.</td>', 'Good expression and wonderful clarity.', '2002-12-26 08:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(178202, 10024, 3127, '<td valign="top">This is great! The colors and clarity are wonderful and I love the content. Great work!</td>', 'This is great! The colors and clarity are wonderful and I love the content. Great work!', '2002-12-26 08:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(178203, 9993, 3127, '<td valign="top">Nice photo and the touch of nail polish remaining leaves me with the idea that the little hand wants to be an adult. Good shot.</td>', 'Nice photo and the touch of nail polish remaining leaves me with the idea that the little hand wants to be an adult. Good shot.', '2002-12-26 08:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(178204, 9867, 3127, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. Needs a bit stronger depth of filed, but still very good.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. Needs a bit stronger depth of filed, but still very good.', '2002-12-26 08:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(178205, 10013, 3127, '<td valign="top">Very cool pic. It always helps to have a photo that makes the onlooker think.</td>', 'Very cool pic. It always helps to have a photo that makes the onlooker think.', '2002-12-26 08:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(178207, 10062, 3127, '<td valign="top">Really great effect. I love this photo!</td>', 'Really great effect. I love this photo!', '2002-12-26 08:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(178287, 9883, 1379, '<td valign="top">EWWWWWW!  This is a great effect!!  It''s really enhanced by your choice of ooze....</td>', 'EWWWWWW!  This is a great effect!!  It''s really enhanced by your choice of ooze....', '2002-12-26 11:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(178288, 9872, 1379, '<td valign="top">Very elegant and tasteful.  B/w worked well here.</td>', 'Very elegant and tasteful.  B/w worked well here.', '2002-12-26 11:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(178289, 9834, 1379, '<td valign="top">I''m laughing!  What a great shot!!</td>', 'I''m laughing!  What a great shot!!', '2002-12-26 11:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(178293, 10007, 1379, '<td valign="top">I wish you had your model disrobe sooner... I recognize the little track of her underpant''s waistband.</td>', 'I wish you had your model disrobe sooner... I recognize the little track of her underpant''s waistband.', '2002-12-26 11:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(178294, 10038, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Interesting effect!!</td>', 'Wow!  Interesting effect!!', '2002-12-26 11:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(178295, 10013, 1379, '<td valign="top">Scary!!!  So strange and interesting!!</td>', 'Scary!!!  So strange and interesting!!', '2002-12-26 11:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(178296, 9867, 1379, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  This guy has a gorgeous back!</td>', 'Awesome!  This guy has a gorgeous back!', '2002-12-26 11:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(178297, 10062, 1379, '<td valign="top">What a great idea!</td>', 'What a great idea!', '2002-12-26 11:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(178300, 9997, 1379, '<td valign="top">Awww, honey, you DO need a manicure!</td>', 'Awww, honey, you DO need a manicure!', '2002-12-26 11:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(178307, 10003, 4055, '<td valign="top">I like this. Good lighting and composition. Perfect focus. Well done and good luck!</td>', 'I like this. Good lighting and composition. Perfect focus. Well done and good luck!', '2002-12-26 12:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(178320, 9901, 4055, '<td valign="top">I have looked over and over again to be able to say which I like best - your b&amp;w one or this. But I can´t say. I think both are very good. Perhaps this one in b&amp;w? I really don´t know. Anyway, you have two good shots this week. Good luck!</td>', 'I have looked over and over again to be able to say which I like best - your b&w one or this. But I can´t say. I think both are very good. Perhaps this one in b&w? I really don´t know. Anyway, you have two good shots this week. Good luck!', '2002-12-26 12:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(178326, 9872, 4055, '<td valign="top">I like it very much. Good composition and perfect in b&amp;w. Perhaps a little burned out in the white parts but it´s just a little. Overall very good work. Good luck!</td>', 'I like it very much. Good composition and perfect in b&w. Perhaps a little burned out in the white parts but it´s just a little. Overall very good work. Good luck!', '2002-12-26 12:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(178330, 10061, 4055, '<td valign="top">This is very good. Focus, composition and framing is really nice. And the colours are just marvelous. Good luck!</td>', 'This is very good. Focus, composition and framing is really nice. And the colours are just marvelous. Good luck!', '2002-12-26 12:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(178382, 10013, 806, '<td valign="top">strangely bizzarre idea. is that orange juice? a bit noisy in the orange/yellow parts, but done well otherwise.</td>', 'strangely bizzarre idea. is that orange juice? a bit noisy in the orange/yellow parts, but done well otherwise.', '2002-12-26 15:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(178383, 10040, 806, '<td valign="top">A nice spin on an eye shot. It becomes a story here instead of merely a documentary shot of the eye. Love the color, and intent look. Mystical.</td>', 'A nice spin on an eye shot. It becomes a story here instead of merely a documentary shot of the eye. Love the color, and intent look. Mystical.', '2002-12-26 15:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(178384, 9941, 806, '<td valign="top">exquisite detail. captured emotion. nice work.</td>', 'exquisite detail. captured emotion. nice work.', '2002-12-26 15:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(178386, 10070, 806, '<td valign="top">The louvered doors/shutters in the background distract from this. I think this is a manequin.. is it? would be more powerful with a completely black background.</td>', 'The louvered doors/shutters in the background distract from this. I think this is a manequin.. is it? would be more powerful with a completely black background.', '2002-12-26 15:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(178395, 10068, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good one. nice thick lashes make good contrast, but the DOF is a bit off, only a couple of lashes (on the right) are in focus.</td>', 'Good one. nice thick lashes make good contrast, but the DOF is a bit off, only a couple of lashes (on the right) are in focus.', '2002-12-26 15:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(178407, 9880, 3084, '<td valign="top">WOW, a great shot.  Just waiting to be kissed.</td>', 'WOW, a great shot.  Just waiting to be kissed.', '2002-12-26 16:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(178408, 9982, 3084, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, very expressive.  One of my favourites this week.</td>', 'Wonderful image, very expressive.  One of my favourites this week.', '2002-12-26 16:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(178410, 10007, 3084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, I wonder what it looked like in colour?</td>', 'Beautiful, I wonder what it looked like in colour?', '2002-12-26 16:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(178411, 9933, 3084, '<td valign="top">Fun image, great work</td>', 'Fun image, great work', '2002-12-26 16:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(178420, 10038, 5511, '<td valign="top">Góð hjá þér ''Arni......</td>', 'Góð hjá þér ''Arni......', '2002-12-26 17:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(178471, 10066, 4648, '<td valign="top">Would have been much better in natural skin tones.  Also a little dark, but good focus and nice idea.  Would be a 7 from me.  PLT</td>', 'Would have been much better in natural skin tones.  Also a little dark, but good focus and nice idea.  Would be a 7 from me.  PLT', '2002-12-26 20:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(178472, 9901, 4648, '<td valign="top">The skin tones are beautiful here.  You can see so much difference in the three hands.  The strength in dad''s, gentleness in mom''s, and trusting and innocence in baby''s.  This speaks volumns.  If I could score would be a ten.  Technically it is right on and speaks emotions.  PLT</td>', 'The skin tones are beautiful here.  You can see so much difference in the three hands.  The strength in dad''s, gentleness in mom''s, and trusting and innocence in baby''s.  This speaks volumns.  If I could score would be a ten.  Technically it is right on and speaks emotions.  PLT', '2002-12-26 20:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(178473, 9893, 4648, '<td valign="top">Would be "Au Natural" had it been in natural skin tones, and would have been worth about 3 or more points over as is.  Good composition just needs better execution.  PTL</td>', 'Would be "Au Natural" had it been in natural skin tones, and would have been worth about 3 or more points over as is.  Good composition just needs better execution.  PTL', '2002-12-26 20:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(178474, 9911, 4648, '<td valign="top">The hand on the bottom looks deformed the way it is posed.  The way the shadow is on the face it makes the nose look deformed also.  A little too dark.  Personally don''t think with hands as subject you should have cropped part of the left hand off.  Would bea 4 in my book.  PTL</td>', 'The hand on the bottom looks deformed the way it is posed.  The way the shadow is on the face it makes the nose look deformed also.  A little too dark.  Personally don''t think with hands as subject you should have cropped part of the left hand off.  Would bea 4 in my book.  PTL', '2002-12-26 20:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(178475, 9967, 4648, '<td valign="top">The way this foot is posed it looks like the "foot rug".  Also the way it is cropped a better title would be "Toes".  We see very little of the "foot".  I would like to know how you got the toes spread so far apart.  But I couldn''t score this higher than a 5 and that would be stretching it.  PTL</td>', 'The way this foot is posed it looks like the "foot rug".  Also the way it is cropped a better title would be "Toes".  We see very little of the "foot".  I would like to know how you got the toes spread so far apart.  But I couldn''t score this higher than a 5 and that would be stretching it.  PTL', '2002-12-26 20:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(178476, 9894, 4648, '<td valign="top">This and "Within Earshot" look to be the same.  Like it that you can actually see the fuss on the ear, but sickening is the fact you can see black heads in the ear and that is a great big turn off.  I would give this a 1.  PTL</td>', 'This and "Within Earshot" look to be the same.  Like it that you can actually see the fuss on the ear, but sickening is the fact you can see black heads in the ear and that is a great big turn off.  I would give this a 1.  PTL', '2002-12-26 20:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(178477, 9962, 4648, '<td valign="top">Very similular to "wisperview".  I''m trying to decide if I like the shadow inside the ear.  In a way it makes the external parts of the ear appear to be a frame for the dark.  But at the same time it is hiding a good part of the ear.  Would have liked this to be in color to offset the darkness in the ear.  Would have like a tighter crop on the bottom and right side to make the ear be all of it, especially since it is not in natural skin tone.  PTL</td>', 'Very similular to "wisperview".  I''m trying to decide if I like the shadow inside the ear.  In a way it makes the external parts of the ear appear to be a frame for the dark.  But at the same time it is hiding a good part of the ear.  Would have liked this to be in color to offset the darkness in the ear.  Would have like a tighter crop on the bottom and right side to make the ear be all of it, especially since it is not in natural skin tone.  PTL', '2002-12-26 20:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(178479, 9890, 4648, '<td valign="top">Can''t quite figure out what the arm is supposed to be sticking out of.  This hand more speaks life of hard work, rather than sorrow or loneliness.  Not really thrilled by this shot.  PTL</td>', 'Can''t quite figure out what the arm is supposed to be sticking out of.  This hand more speaks life of hard work, rather than sorrow or loneliness.  Not really thrilled by this shot.  PTL', '2002-12-26 20:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(178481, 9919, 4648, '<td valign="top">The way he''s turned it is the shoulder, rather than the back.  It appears the tatoo is your subject here this way.  It also appears to be a portrait with the way the head is posed rather than a shot of a part of the body.  It is in good focus and beautiful color and I love the background.  The background is georgeous.  Nice shot, I just think your subject is off.  PTL</td>', 'The way he''s turned it is the shoulder, rather than the back.  It appears the tatoo is your subject here this way.  It also appears to be a portrait with the way the head is posed rather than a shot of a part of the body.  It is in good focus and beautiful color and I love the background.  The background is georgeous.  Nice shot, I just think your subject is off.  PTL', '2002-12-26 20:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(178483, 9867, 4648, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the thick frame at the top and bottom at all.  It, for me anyway, distrubs the picture.  With the muscles flexed as they are the hands should have been extended as straight out as possible.  The release seems to flow from the back out the arms and stops without coming on out the hands.</td>', 'Don''t like the thick frame at the top and bottom at all.  It, for me anyway, distrubs the picture.  With the muscles flexed as they are the hands should have been extended as straight out as possible.  The release seems to flow from the back out the arms and stops without coming on out the hands.', '2002-12-26 20:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(178485, 9982, 4648, '<td valign="top">Like the way you set apart the eyes.  It''s different.  The white frame with the thin black edging works well on this.  Technically you have this pinned down right.  A good shot, and as I said, different.   PTL</td>', 'Like the way you set apart the eyes.  It''s different.  The white frame with the thin black edging works well on this.  Technically you have this pinned down right.  A good shot, and as I said, different.   PTL', '2002-12-26 20:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(178488, 9858, 4648, '<td valign="top">Much too dark.  Parts of the ear are cut off.  Good idea, just poor execution.  PTL</td>', 'Much too dark.  Parts of the ear are cut off.  Good idea, just poor execution.  PTL', '2002-12-26 20:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(178489, 9935, 4648, '<td valign="top">Too dark and too off color.  Hands are almost orange in color.  Good focus, good crop, good set up and composition, just needs better execution.  PTL</td>', 'Too dark and too off color.  Hands are almost orange in color.  Good focus, good crop, good set up and composition, just needs better execution.  PTL', '2002-12-26 20:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(178491, 9915, 4648, '<td valign="top">Left side a little out of focus.  And hand a little red.  But I do like the nice close up crop.  The way the small finger is posed it looks way out of proportion to the rest of the hand.  It appears if it were to be straightened out it would be longer than the middle finger, as does the ring finger.  But that''s just my opinion.</td>', 'Left side a little out of focus.  And hand a little red.  But I do like the nice close up crop.  The way the small finger is posed it looks way out of proportion to the rest of the hand.  It appears if it were to be straightened out it would be longer than the middle finger, as does the ring finger.  But that''s just my opinion.', '2002-12-26 20:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(178492, 9827, 4648, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look real this color.  Should have left natural color.  Beautiful texture though.  PTL</td>', 'Doesn''t look real this color.  Should have left natural color.  Beautiful texture though.  PTL', '2002-12-26 20:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(178493, 10005, 4648, '<td valign="top">Too dark and too soft of a focus for me.  But good finger prints.  Very much detail in them.  Personally believe should have been in color.  PTL</td>', 'Too dark and too soft of a focus for me.  But good finger prints.  Very much detail in them.  Personally believe should have been in color.  PTL', '2002-12-26 20:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(178496, 9883, 4648, '<td valign="top">I almost expected a puppet face to be painted on this.  Tis is funny.  Well focused, but I''m not real thrilled with the cropping.  To me it adds nothing and only makes it look like you didn''t know how to crop.    Over all pretty good photo.  PTL</td>', 'I almost expected a puppet face to be painted on this.  Tis is funny.  Well focused, but I''m not real thrilled with the cropping.  To me it adds nothing and only makes it look like you didn''t know how to crop.    Over all pretty good photo.  PTL', '2002-12-26 21:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(178522, 10019, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and framing of this photo. The "Body Parts" element is subtle, which is very refreshing :). Shallow DOF adds a nice smoky feel to this, like it''s in a bar or something. Nice photo.</td>', 'I like the lighting and framing of this photo. The "Body Parts" element is subtle, which is very refreshing :). Shallow DOF adds a nice smoky feel to this, like it''s in a bar or something. Nice photo.', '2002-12-26 22:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(178524, 9993, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, but the lighting is very flat and the colours are a bit muddy. Some more contrast would be nice, to bring out the textures in the hands and darken the background.</td>', 'Cute idea, but the lighting is very flat and the colours are a bit muddy. Some more contrast would be nice, to bring out the textures in the hands and darken the background.', '2002-12-26 23:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(178525, 9934, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. At first the brightness of the candle bothered me, but when I see the effect on the hands, I like it. The little edges of light around the fingers are nice. I think the way you''ve composed this makes my eyes rest more on the candle than the hands, but over time, after looking at the photo more, this seems appropriate.</td>', 'Interesting composition. At first the brightness of the candle bothered me, but when I see the effect on the hands, I like it. The little edges of light around the fingers are nice. I think the way you''ve composed this makes my eyes rest more on the candle than the hands, but over time, after looking at the photo more, this seems appropriate.', '2002-12-26 23:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(178526, 9950, 1037, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the hands is too bright and overexposed here for me to see much except large, almost white areas of skin. It would be nice to see the texture of the skin, the little wrinkles on the fingers, etc.  I like the composition.</td>', 'The lighting on the hands is too bright and overexposed here for me to see much except large, almost white areas of skin. It would be nice to see the texture of the skin, the little wrinkles on the fingers, etc.  I like the composition.', '2002-12-26 23:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(178527, 9845, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting, experimental photo. I almost imagine a mermaid being dragged from the sea, except they usually don''t have buttocks :).<br/> <br/>I think it could be stronger with some different camera angles. It''s too symmetrical and static like this, for me. That makes the effect of the net a bit flat and uninteresting, when a higher or lower camera angle would bring out the distortion of the net with added perspective.</td>', 'Interesting, experimental photo. I almost imagine a mermaid being dragged from the sea, except they usually don''t have buttocks :). I think it could be stronger with some different camera angles. It''s too symmetrical and static like this, for me. That makes the effect of the net a bit flat and uninteresting, when a higher or lower camera angle would bring out the distortion of the net with added perspective.', '2002-12-26 23:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(178528, 9834, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a cool idea, but I think the feet are a bit washed out. They seem like porcelain or something. I like to see textures and wrinkles in skin. The composition is nice, and the idea is cute.</td>', 'This is a cool idea, but I think the feet are a bit washed out. They seem like porcelain or something. I like to see textures and wrinkles in skin. The composition is nice, and the idea is cute.', '2002-12-26 23:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(178530, 9901, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very sweet photo. I like the composition and camera angle here. The skin tones are beautiful, brought out by subtle, warm lighting. Good work.</td>', 'Very sweet photo. I like the composition and camera angle here. The skin tones are beautiful, brought out by subtle, warm lighting. Good work.', '2002-12-26 23:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(178531, 9894, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love this! The close cropping is really interesting. The black and white is rich, bringing out all the texture of the skin, along with the nice lighting. The ear almost seems translucent. Nice shallow DOF too. A 10 from me.</td>', 'I love this! The close cropping is really interesting. The black and white is rich, bringing out all the texture of the skin, along with the nice lighting. The ear almost seems translucent. Nice shallow DOF too. A 10 from me.', '2002-12-26 23:15:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(178532, 9997, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo if just for all the texture in that skin (although cuticles like that make me feel uncomfortable!). The lighting and composition here are cool.</td>', 'Interesting photo if just for all the texture in that skin (although cuticles like that make me feel uncomfortable!). The lighting and composition here are cool.', '2002-12-26 23:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(178533, 9911, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love the strong shadows in this photo. The lighting is very dramatic, but not so much that the texture of the skin is lost. The composition is great.</td>', 'I love the strong shadows in this photo. The lighting is very dramatic, but not so much that the texture of the skin is lost. The composition is great.', '2002-12-26 23:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(178534, 10070, 1037, '<td valign="top">That is just so cool! I love the shape of that breast, it''s just such a beautiful curve. Mine are too big for photos like this (sigh). I''m giving this 10!</td>', 'That is just so cool! I love the shape of that breast, it''s just such a beautiful curve. Mine are too big for photos like this (sigh). I''m giving this 10!', '2002-12-26 23:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(178535, 10062, 1037, '<td valign="top">VERY cool effect. I love the way light can shine through fingers. Great idea, carried off well.</td>', 'VERY cool effect. I love the way light can shine through fingers. Great idea, carried off well.', '2002-12-26 23:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(178536, 9914, 1037, '<td valign="top">The light here is too harsh. The tension in the fingers is a cool idea, but it isn''t shown off well by the lighting. I think this could have worked well in black and white. The composition is a little bit awkward to me.</td>', 'The light here is too harsh. The tension in the fingers is a cool idea, but it isn''t shown off well by the lighting. I think this could have worked well in black and white. The composition is a little bit awkward to me.', '2002-12-26 23:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(178537, 10082, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a cool, if disgusting photo :).  The composition is great, and the beard hair is shown in all its glory, along with the textures on the tongue. Somehow I really like this, although I feel like I''m about to be tongue kissed by an old letch!</td>', 'This is a cool, if disgusting photo :).  The composition is great, and the beard hair is shown in all its glory, along with the textures on the tongue. Somehow I really like this, although I feel like I''m about to be tongue kissed by an old letch!', '2002-12-26 23:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(178538, 10012, 1037, '<td valign="top">There''s a really delicate, subtle, warm beauty to this photo. I can see you desaturated the red channel to get this effect. Great work. The lighting is very soft and the composition is strong. The expression on the face is kind of innocent and dreamy. I like this a lot.</td>', 'There''s a really delicate, subtle, warm beauty to this photo. I can see you desaturated the red channel to get this effect. Great work. The lighting is very soft and the composition is strong. The expression on the face is kind of innocent and dreamy. I like this a lot.', '2002-12-26 23:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(178539, 9989, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really like the grain and soft focus in this image, but the title is a bit corny. The image has a simple beauty to it. The lighting is so warm and inviting. I like it a lot.</td>', 'I really like the grain and soft focus in this image, but the title is a bit corny. The image has a simple beauty to it. The lighting is so warm and inviting. I like it a lot.', '2002-12-26 23:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(178540, 10014, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting background, and the composition of this is actually pretty strong, but the photo doesn''t really interest me.</td>', 'Interesting background, and the composition of this is actually pretty strong, but the photo doesn''t really interest me.', '2002-12-26 23:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(178541, 9827, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The colours and textures are gorgeous. I''m guess it''s just skin under a microscope, or maybe a scab? Whatever it is, I get the same kind of feeling from it as a Jackson Pollock painting.</td>', 'I really like this. The colours and textures are gorgeous. I''m guess it''s just skin under a microscope, or maybe a scab? Whatever it is, I get the same kind of feeling from it as a Jackson Pollock painting.', '2002-12-26 23:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(178543, 10038, 1037, '<td valign="top">Striking. I guess that\''s a contact lens. It\''s pretty cool. I love the colours in her iris. The photo doesn\''t grab me as a whole, but it\''s very good.</td>', 'Striking. I guess that\''s a contact lens. It\''s pretty cool. I love the colours in her iris. The photo doesn\''t grab me as a whole, but it\''s very good.', '2002-12-26 23:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(178545, 10007, 1037, '<td valign="top">The lighting is great, bringing out beautiful skin tones. Thematically, it''s just like Setzler''s "Forbidden Fruit" image (is it you again? I have reason to believe so :)). However, the composition of this is so static, centred, symmetrical.... it doesn''t inspire me. It robs all the life from the model.</td>', 'The lighting is great, bringing out beautiful skin tones. Thematically, it''s just like Setzler''s "Forbidden Fruit" image (is it you again? I have reason to believe so :)). However, the composition of this is so static, centred, symmetrical.... it doesn''t inspire me. It robs all the life from the model.', '2002-12-26 23:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(178546, 10081, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting. The lighting is very dramatic, and the pose of the hand is full of tension. I love the way the shadows fall along all those creases on the thumb. It seems as though you pushed the contrast up just a little bit too much though. Otherwise, it''s a great study of a hand.</td>', 'Interesting. The lighting is very dramatic, and the pose of the hand is full of tension. I love the way the shadows fall along all those creases on the thumb. It seems as though you pushed the contrast up just a little bit too much though. Otherwise, it''s a great study of a hand.', '2002-12-26 23:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(178547, 9872, 1037, '<td valign="top">The really soft, grey tones in this are kind of nice, but something doesn''t work for me. The woman''s arm seems so thin in comparison to her head. Maybe it''s a perspective problem, but even for a thin woman her elbow joint seems weirdly small. It probably shouldn''t put me off, but things like that have an odd effect on me! The shadows are nice, and the flowers are an interesting touch.</td>', 'The really soft, grey tones in this are kind of nice, but something doesn''t work for me. The woman''s arm seems so thin in comparison to her head. Maybe it''s a perspective problem, but even for a thin woman her elbow joint seems weirdly small. It probably shouldn''t put me off, but things like that have an odd effect on me! The shadows are nice, and the flowers are an interesting touch.', '2002-12-27 00:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(178548, 9915, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting camera angle, but the composition is a bit flat. The hand seems to take up too much of the photo for me to absorb it all. The light is a bit too strong, also, and the background makes me want to know what''s behind there...  a bed?<br/> <br/>It''s kind of an interesting shot, but doesn''t really work for me.</td>', 'Interesting camera angle, but the composition is a bit flat. The hand seems to take up too much of the photo for me to absorb it all. The light is a bit too strong, also, and the background makes me want to know what''s behind there...  a bed? It''s kind of an interesting shot, but doesn''t really work for me.', '2002-12-27 00:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(178549, 9982, 1037, '<td valign="top">Sweet. Great idea. The light is lovely and soft, making the skin glow like porcelain without being washed out. Those eyes are piercing. I''ll have to give this 10, it''s just beautiful.</td>', 'Sweet. Great idea. The light is lovely and soft, making the skin glow like porcelain without being washed out. Those eyes are piercing. I''ll have to give this 10, it''s just beautiful.', '2002-12-27 00:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(178550, 10072, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hehe, great angle. I like this, it''s unique and interesting. The crop really helps it. Nostrils might be a bit grotesque, but they still have a kind of charm.</td>', 'Hehe, great angle. I like this, it''s unique and interesting. The crop really helps it. Nostrils might be a bit grotesque, but they still have a kind of charm.', '2002-12-27 00:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(178552, 9883, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hmm... this photo doesn''t work for me on a humorous level, or on a creative/artistic level. It''s hard to say much about it. I don''t think it''s a particularly bad photo, but it doesn''t appeal to me.</td>', 'Hmm... this photo doesn''t work for me on a humorous level, or on a creative/artistic level. It''s hard to say much about it. I don''t think it''s a particularly bad photo, but it doesn''t appeal to me.', '2002-12-27 00:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(178553, 9893, 1037, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! I love the DOF in this, and the lighting. The composition is perfect. It''s just wonderful. A 10 from me.</td>', 'Gorgeous! I love the DOF in this, and the lighting. The composition is perfect. It''s just wonderful. A 10 from me.', '2002-12-27 00:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(178556, 9867, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very cool! The camera angle is awesome. I love the highlight that runs along the backs of his arms and over the shoulder blades. The composition is stunning. A definite 10 from me.</td>', 'Very cool! The camera angle is awesome. I love the highlight that runs along the backs of his arms and over the shoulder blades. The composition is stunning. A definite 10 from me.', '2002-12-27 00:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(178557, 10003, 1037, '<td valign="top">Great study. The texture in the skin is gorgeous. I love the veins on the back of the hand too. The composition is very strong.</td>', 'Great study. The texture in the skin is gorgeous. I love the veins on the back of the hand too. The composition is very strong.', '2002-12-27 00:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(178559, 9888, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool! I love the overexposed, oversaturated look. Very bold and brash. Refreshing and unique after all the subtlety of most of the other photos in this challenge (including mine). I''m giving it 10.</td>', 'Cool! I love the overexposed, oversaturated look. Very bold and brash. Refreshing and unique after all the subtlety of most of the other photos in this challenge (including mine). I''m giving it 10.', '2002-12-27 00:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(178561, 9962, 1037, '<td valign="top">A little bit dull in its composition/camera angle. The lighting is cool though. I like that big shadow under the earlobe and the darkness inside the ear, and the slightly soft focus works for me.</td>', 'A little bit dull in its composition/camera angle. The lighting is cool though. I like that big shadow under the earlobe and the darkness inside the ear, and the slightly soft focus works for me.', '2002-12-27 00:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(178562, 9941, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting, bold composition. Technically a good photo. I like the warm colour of the skin and the details in the iris.</td>', 'Interesting, bold composition. Technically a good photo. I like the warm colour of the skin and the details in the iris.', '2002-12-27 00:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(178563, 10005, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. The detail in the fingertips is nice, and the dramatic lighting. But the photo as a whole doesn''t grab me.</td>', 'Interesting idea. The detail in the fingertips is nice, and the dramatic lighting. But the photo as a whole doesn''t grab me.', '2002-12-27 00:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(178564, 10024, 1037, '<td valign="top">The lighting is too strong, making the feet washed out. The composition is a bit weak also. More negative space above the feet would look better, I think.</td>', 'The lighting is too strong, making the feet washed out. The composition is a bit weak also. More negative space above the feet would look better, I think.', '2002-12-27 00:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(178565, 9933, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hehe, cool idea. Looks like the kind of mugshot an aspiring actor would hand out to agents, maybe. I like the composition. I feel like the light is a little bit too strong, though.</td>', 'Hehe, cool idea. Looks like the kind of mugshot an aspiring actor would hand out to agents, maybe. I like the composition. I feel like the light is a little bit too strong, though.', '2002-12-27 00:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(178566, 9935, 1037, '<td valign="top">The yellow cast to the skin is a bit weird and sickly. The composition is strong, though. Maybe in black and white this would have been more dramatic.</td>', 'The yellow cast to the skin is a bit weird and sickly. The composition is strong, though. Maybe in black and white this would have been more dramatic.', '2002-12-27 00:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(178569, 9967, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Very dramatic and creative. The shapes of those toes is really weird, and the purple light is vivid. Great work.</td>', 'I like this a lot. Very dramatic and creative. The shapes of those toes is really weird, and the purple light is vivid. Great work.', '2002-12-27 00:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(178570, 9890, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting and surreal. I like the high contrast and the interesting composition.</td>', 'Interesting and surreal. I like the high contrast and the interesting composition.', '2002-12-27 00:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(178571, 10079, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cute...  but I think you could learn a lot from the other bellybutton shot (with the bird tattoo) in this challenge. A more distant view, with warm lighting would be a lot nicer. This close,  I can see a lot of detail of skin, hair, scars, blemishes, etc. that don''t really enhance the photo. Even in comparison to an all out grotesque shot like the tongue photo or the nostril photo in this challenge, this just doesn''t work.</td>', 'Cute...  but I think you could learn a lot from the other bellybutton shot (with the bird tattoo) in this challenge. A more distant view, with warm lighting would be a lot nicer. This close,  I can see a lot of detail of skin, hair, scars, blemishes, etc. that don''t really enhance the photo. Even in comparison to an all out grotesque shot like the tongue photo or the nostril photo in this challenge, this just doesn''t work.', '2002-12-27 00:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(178573, 9977, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like the motion in this shot. The composition is a bit busy though, and the hand isn''t emphasised enough. A closeup, with a different angle to fit the hand, cue and ball in the shot, would have been more interesting.</td>', 'I like the motion in this shot. The composition is a bit busy though, and the hand isn''t emphasised enough. A closeup, with a different angle to fit the hand, cue and ball in the shot, would have been more interesting.', '2002-12-27 00:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(178574, 10035, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. There''s something that appeals to me about it. I love those old bathtubs :). An interesting, quirky way to photograph an arm!</td>', 'Interesting shot. There''s something that appeals to me about it. I love those old bathtubs :). An interesting, quirky way to photograph an arm!', '2002-12-27 00:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(178575, 10066, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very lovely, warm skin tones. I like the sepia tint. The composition is great, especially the way those finger tips lie along the curve of the younger person''s hand. A very tactile image with lots of texture and feeling.</td>', 'Very lovely, warm skin tones. I like the sepia tint. The composition is great, especially the way those finger tips lie along the curve of the younger person''s hand. A very tactile image with lots of texture and feeling.', '2002-12-27 00:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(178577, 10013, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is very, very cool. I think perhaps the composition is a little bit awkward. A tighter crop would work better, maybe. But I love the surrealism of this photo!</td>', 'This is very, very cool. I think perhaps the composition is a little bit awkward. A tighter crop would work better, maybe. But I love the surrealism of this photo!', '2002-12-27 00:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(178578, 10009, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love all the texture in this photo - wool, skin, truffles, dirt, courduroy pants. It really evokes a mood of being outside in the winter light. The sepia toning complements it very well. Nice work.</td>', 'I love all the texture in this photo - wool, skin, truffles, dirt, courduroy pants. It really evokes a mood of being outside in the winter light. The sepia toning complements it very well. Nice work.', '2002-12-27 00:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(178579, 10040, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting eerie effect. Very moody. Of all the eye shots, this one is the most interesting to me. It''s a little washed out, but I like it. Great composition too.</td>', 'Interesting eerie effect. Very moody. Of all the eye shots, this one is the most interesting to me. It''s a little washed out, but I like it. Great composition too.', '2002-12-27 00:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(178580, 9844, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The shadow comes up well, and I like the texture of the paper screen. The frame of the screen doesn''t strike me, though. It''s at a slight angle, and the colour isn''t very complementary to the dark shadow. A closeup on the screen and adding a border afterwards would work better for me.</td>', 'Nice idea. The shadow comes up well, and I like the texture of the paper screen. The frame of the screen doesn''t strike me, though. It''s at a slight angle, and the colour isn''t very complementary to the dark shadow. A closeup on the screen and adding a border afterwards would work better for me.', '2002-12-27 01:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(178581, 9880, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but I would have much preferred this without so much lipstick. It''s so caked on, and the lipliner is the wrong colour! It ruins the softness of the surrounding skin (which is caked in powder, but still looks almost natural).<br/> <br/>It''s probably just my personal taste, but I don''t like makeup very much. The only place it looks good to me is on stage.</td>', 'Nice photo, but I would have much preferred this without so much lipstick. It''s so caked on, and the lipliner is the wrong colour! It ruins the softness of the surrounding skin (which is caked in powder, but still looks almost natural). It''s probably just my personal taste, but I don''t like makeup very much. The only place it looks good to me is on stage.', '2002-12-27 01:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(178582, 10061, 1037, '<td valign="top">This has a really nice watercolour painting feel to it. The colours are weird, but I like that. The tattoo and bellybutton piercing a really gorgeous. I like the way the lighting picks out asymmetrical shadows over her tummy. Very nice work.</td>', 'This has a really nice watercolour painting feel to it. The colours are weird, but I like that. The tattoo and bellybutton piercing a really gorgeous. I like the way the lighting picks out asymmetrical shadows over her tummy. Very nice work.', '2002-12-27 01:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(178583, 10068, 1037, '<td valign="top">One of the moodier eye photos. The composition doesn''t grab me, but the high contrast black and white is very nice. I like the shallow DOF.</td>', 'One of the moodier eye photos. The composition doesn''t grab me, but the high contrast black and white is very nice. I like the shallow DOF.', '2002-12-27 01:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(178584, 9858, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s weird. The skin is so red and leathery. I don''t know what''s obscuring the rest of the face. It seems like a really old guy wearing a turban....<br/> <br/>This photo isn''t very appealing to me. The composition and cropping are good, but I don''t really understand the image.</td>', 'Wow, that''s weird. The skin is so red and leathery. I don''t know what''s obscuring the rest of the face. It seems like a really old guy wearing a turban.... This photo isn''t very appealing to me. The composition and cropping are good, but I don''t really understand the image.', '2002-12-27 01:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(178585, 9919, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting that you scaled this down so much. I can''t really see that tattoo. It seems more of an odd portrait than a study of a back. I can''t see any skin texture or muscles, so my eye is drawn to either the tattoo or the face.</td>', 'Interesting that you scaled this down so much. I can''t really see that tattoo. It seems more of an odd portrait than a study of a back. I can''t see any skin texture or muscles, so my eye is drawn to either the tattoo or the face.', '2002-12-27 01:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(178586, 9907, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting and pretty. It seems like she''s made up for the stage... paying in "the Mikado" or something. I like the effect of the body paint on the skin. The costume and hair decorations are gorgeous, and the pink background sets it all off well.</td>', 'Interesting and pretty. It seems like she''s made up for the stage... paying in "the Mikado" or something. I like the effect of the body paint on the skin. The costume and hair decorations are gorgeous, and the pink background sets it all off well.', '2002-12-27 01:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(178599, 9915, 4411, '<td valign="top">While the focus is good, and composition is okay, the image doesn''t have anything to really grab the attention. It doesn''t say anything to me beyond ''snapshot of a hand''.<br/>The same shot in black &amp; white may provoke more interest, though I feel that it is probably overlit. A few strong shadows may add to the image.<br/>Above average but not great to me.</td>', 'While the focus is good, and composition is okay, the image doesn''t have anything to really grab the attention. It doesn''t say anything to me beyond ''snapshot of a hand''.The same shot in black & white may provoke more interest, though I feel that it is probably overlit. A few strong shadows may add to the image.Above average but not great to me.', '2002-12-27 08:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(178600, 10014, 4411, '<td valign="top">A nice hand shadow, and a message I couldn''t agree with more.<br/>Personally I would have cropped as tightly as possible around the hand and shadow,while keeping roughly the same aspect ratio - I think the background dominates the image too much as it is.</td>', 'A nice hand shadow, and a message I couldn''t agree with more.Personally I would have cropped as tightly as possible around the hand and shadow,while keeping roughly the same aspect ratio - I think the background dominates the image too much as it is.', '2002-12-27 08:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(178601, 10072, 4411, '<td valign="top">Not a pretty sight!<br/>Composition is good and the crop works well here, however there are a few blown out areasthat detract from the image.<br/>The nose does provide a very interesting shape and focal point though.</td>', 'Not a pretty sight!Composition is good and the crop works well here, however there are a few blown out areasthat detract from the image.The nose does provide a very interesting shape and focal point though.', '2002-12-27 08:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(178602, 9982, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely image and well composed. It seems very grainy though I quite like that and am curious as to whether it is deliberate.<br/>The only thing I don''t like at all is the border which I don''t think is the right choice for this image.</td>', 'This is a lovely image and well composed. It seems very grainy though I quite like that and am curious as to whether it is deliberate.The only thing I don''t like at all is the border which I don''t think is the right choice for this image.', '2002-12-27 08:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(178603, 10012, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait though I am not keen on the grey pallor of the skin... I assume you''ve desaturated reds or something? I think I''d prefer to see this with more life in the skin. I really like the choice of background.</td>', 'Nice portrait though I am not keen on the grey pallor of the skin... I assume you''ve desaturated reds or something? I think I''d prefer to see this with more life in the skin. I really like the choice of background.', '2002-12-27 08:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(178605, 10035, 3087, '<td valign="top">Hey Lisa, I like your shower curtain... and the claw foot bath too! Veeery elegant! ;)</td>', 'Hey Lisa, I like your shower curtain... and the claw foot bath too! Veeery elegant! ;)', '2002-12-27 09:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(178606, 9967, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is kind of spooky and I have to keep counting to make sure there are only 5 toes! I like it!</td>', 'This is kind of spooky and I have to keep counting to make sure there are only 5 toes! I like it!', '2002-12-27 09:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(178608, 9869, 3087, '<td valign="top">Really interesting composition, though lighting a little uneven - too much white on the front of the calf. Seems a little blurred in the hand and foot. Great clean blackground. Do you do yoga? :) On second thoughts, does the leg belong the same person as the shoulder/ arm?</td>', 'Really interesting composition, though lighting a little uneven - too much white on the front of the calf. Seems a little blurred in the hand and foot. Great clean blackground. Do you do yoga? :) On second thoughts, does the leg belong the same person as the shoulder/ arm?', '2002-12-27 09:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(178624, 9934, 4055, '<td valign="top">Like the composition very much. It´s very hard to get focus perfect but I think it´s acceptable here. The hands are the most important and they´re ok.  I had probably mad it a little bit darker and perhaps in b&amp;w. Overall well done!</td>', 'Like the composition very much. It´s very hard to get focus perfect but I think it´s acceptable here. The hands are the most important and they´re ok.  I had probably mad it a little bit darker and perhaps in b&w. Overall well done!', '2002-12-27 09:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(178627, 9872, 4411, '<td valign="top">Overall a very nice image.<br/>While there are areas which seem to be blown out, it is a very soft effect and not the usual harsh overlit look, so it doesn''t detract too much.<br/>My favourite part is the arm. If the lighting was like this across the body this would be an even better shot.</td>', 'Overall a very nice image.While there are areas which seem to be blown out, it is a very soft effect and not the usual harsh overlit look, so it doesn''t detract too much.My favourite part is the arm. If the lighting was like this across the body this would be an even better shot.', '2002-12-27 09:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(178628, 9869, 4411, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and a very unusual pose.<br/>Focus doesn''t seem quite spot on, but maybe this is due to a bit of motion?<br/>The composition is very good, as is the lighting. Well done.</td>', 'Nice shot and a very unusual pose.Focus doesn''t seem quite spot on, but maybe this is due to a bit of motion?The composition is very good, as is the lighting. Well done.', '2002-12-27 09:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(178630, 9834, 4411, '<td valign="top">At first I felt that this was overlit, but looking at the small feet, which have some nice shadows &amp; details, I think the lighting is right but the other feet should have been angled too.<br/>The overall compostion also seems a bit too random for me.<br/>Nice job blacking out the rest of the bodies and good focus.</td>', 'At first I felt that this was overlit, but looking at the small feet, which have some nice shadows & details, I think the lighting is right but the other feet should have been angled too.The overall compostion also seems a bit too random for me.Nice job blacking out the rest of the bodies and good focus.', '2002-12-27 10:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(178632, 10035, 4411, '<td valign="top">Nice bathroom.<br/>An interesting idea for the challenge and well executed. Lighting and composition are good and the arm provides a nice break in colour amongst all the shades of white.</td>', 'Nice bathroom.An interesting idea for the challenge and well executed. Lighting and composition are good and the arm provides a nice break in colour amongst all the shades of white.', '2002-12-27 10:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(178633, 10024, 5606, '<td valign="top">very cute idea reminds me of a greeting card</td>', 'very cute idea reminds me of a greeting card', '2002-12-27 10:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(178634, 9941, 4411, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and great detail in the eye.<br/>Having the eye looking to the side is a bit disorienting though!</td>', 'Nice composition and great detail in the eye.Having the eye looking to the side is a bit disorienting though!', '2002-12-27 10:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(178635, 9845, 4411, '<td valign="top">Very nice colours and good composition. My only complaint would be that the body doesn''t have enough contrast, probably because of the net.</td>', 'Very nice colours and good composition. My only complaint would be that the body doesn''t have enough contrast, probably because of the net.', '2002-12-27 10:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
