(178671, 9890, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is definately a sad looking hand.  however, I supose that''s the point.  I like the concept very much.  I think that the exposure is good, and the angle and framing/cropping are good too.  I like how the hand is not directly in the center of the photo.  Great shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is definately a sad looking hand.  however, I supose that''s the point.  I like the concept very much.  I think that the exposure is good, and the angle and framing/cropping are good too.  I like how the hand is not directly in the center of the photo.  Great shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-27 13:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(178727, 9935, 2170, '<td valign="top">I like the attempt at a warm tone, but the yellow tint is a bit much for me.  Great shot, though.</td>', 'I like the attempt at a warm tone, but the yellow tint is a bit much for me.  Great shot, though.', '2002-12-27 17:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
