(178985, 9880, 3294, '<td valign="top">I might have preferred there be _less_ clarity.  With the light at that angle, the texture of the skin pops out, when the focus is supposed to be the lips.  Nit sure how to obtain this without some type of camera lens filter or with some clever post processing.  I think the lighting created a hot spot on her nose too.  Not sure how I feel about the lips being slightly cropped.  This photo stands out a lot in the challenge.</td>', 'I might have preferred there be _less_ clarity.  With the light at that angle, the texture of the skin pops out, when the focus is supposed to be the lips.  Nit sure how to obtain this without some type of camera lens filter or with some clever post processing.  I think the lighting created a hot spot on her nose too.  Not sure how I feel about the lips being slightly cropped.  This photo stands out a lot in the challenge.', '2002-12-28 20:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(178986, 9934, 3294, '<td valign="top">Working with candles is a challenge in itself.  The flame throws the auto exposure into chaos.  But I like the idea and the slight flare adds to the atmosphere.  If only there was a way to prevent the light from being so bright.  Hmmm....</td>', 'Working with candles is a challenge in itself.  The flame throws the auto exposure into chaos.  But I like the idea and the slight flare adds to the atmosphere.  If only there was a way to prevent the light from being so bright.  Hmmm....', '2002-12-28 21:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
