(178993, 9911, 3294, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... this is my only 9... my second highest mark for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot... this is my only 9... my second highest mark for this challenge.', '2002-12-28 21:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(179041, 9934, 5822, '<td valign="top">The essence of faith and prayer is what this image conveys to me. Great religious shot...I love the way the light from the candle falls on the hands and also like the pitch black background and floating candle, which gives the photo a spiritual and even mystical feel.  Because the face and hands are of different tones (face much more yellow and mask-like, and hands more red), there seems to be a dissociation between the two. Now, maybe this was done intentionally because from a philosophical point of view, the photographer could be stating that faith is not about the intellect, but about the heart. Can you comment on that?</td>', 'The essence of faith and prayer is what this image conveys to me. Great religious shot...I love the way the light from the candle falls on the hands and also like the pitch black background and floating candle, which gives the photo a spiritual and even mystical feel.  Because the face and hands are of different tones (face much more yellow and mask-like, and hands more red), there seems to be a dissociation between the two. Now, maybe this was done intentionally because from a philosophical point of view, the photographer could be stating that faith is not about the intellect, but about the heart. Can you comment on that?', '2002-12-29 00:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(179073, 10007, 1829, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  I really like how the shadow falls from the apple into the centre of the picture.  The lighting is great also.  Good luck in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'Nice job.  I really like how the shadow falls from the apple into the centre of the picture.  The lighting is great also.  Good luck in this weeks challenge.', '2002-12-29 02:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
