(179151, 9867, 2553, '<td valign="top">I really like your idea, and your composition, but overall feel  that the shot is a little dark for my taste.  I like the color, but would like to see a little more tonal range.</td>', 'I really like your idea, and your composition, but overall feel  that the shot is a little dark for my taste.  I like the color, but would like to see a little more tonal range.', '2002-12-29 12:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(179152, 9872, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love the black and white, and I do like the concept, and the lighting.  I''m not crazy about the composition; I find the model''s face at the top of the frame to be somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Love the black and white, and I do like the concept, and the lighting.  I''m not crazy about the composition; I find the model''s face at the top of the frame to be somewhat distracting.', '2002-12-29 12:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(179153, 10012, 2553, '<td valign="top">I do like this shot a lot, but really want to see those eyes looking more into the camera!</td>', 'I do like this shot a lot, but really want to see those eyes looking more into the camera!', '2002-12-29 12:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(179154, 9934, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot that definitely conveys the "prayerful" feeling of putting hands together in prayer.</td>', 'Very nice shot that definitely conveys the "prayerful" feeling of putting hands together in prayer.', '2002-12-29 12:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(179155, 10007, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice color and composition.</td>', 'Nice color and composition.', '2002-12-29 12:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(179166, 9867, 2223, '<td valign="top">i like the border, looks like a frame from a movie strip..nice.</td>', 'i like the border, looks like a frame from a movie strip..nice.', '2002-12-29 13:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(179167, 9982, 2223, '<td valign="top">very imaginitive, love those blue eyes.</td>', 'very imaginitive, love those blue eyes.', '2002-12-29 13:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(179168, 9834, 2223, '<td valign="top">nice composition and contrast..tickle tickle</td>', 'nice composition and contrast..tickle tickle', '2002-12-29 13:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(179169, 9883, 2223, '<td valign="top">my first thought...ewwwwww.... excellent illusion!</td>', 'my first thought...ewwwwww.... excellent illusion!', '2002-12-29 13:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(179170, 10007, 2223, '<td valign="top">i like the soft tones, framing could be a little better.</td>', 'i like the soft tones, framing could be a little better.', '2002-12-29 13:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(179171, 9888, 2223, '<td valign="top">i cant tell if this is a male or female????? its too oversaturated for my taste.</td>', 'i cant tell if this is a male or female????? its too oversaturated for my taste.', '2002-12-29 13:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(179174, 9935, 2223, '<td valign="top">nice tones</td>', 'nice tones', '2002-12-29 13:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(179177, 10070, 2223, '<td valign="top">love the title..interesting body art. i would have cropped in tighter.</td>', 'love the title..interesting body art. i would have cropped in tighter.', '2002-12-29 13:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(179204, 9883, 2954, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot. Gross, but still nice. awmk1981</td>', 'This is a really nice shot. Gross, but still nice. awmk1981', '2002-12-29 15:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(179205, 9883, 4411, '<td valign="top">Ick. That''s a  little *too* realistic!<br/>Good lighting, focus, very good composition. Nice work.</td>', 'Ick. That''s a  little *too* realistic!Good lighting, focus, very good composition. Nice work.', '2002-12-29 16:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(179269, 9867, 4457, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful! Gets full marks from me.</td>', 'This is beautiful! Gets full marks from me.', '2002-12-29 19:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(179294, 9933, 4648, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if these hands belong to the head or belong to someone standing behind him.  Nice B&amp;W.  Good focus, nice and soft.  Very good composition with good execution. The facial expression is almost non-expressive - very good for this shot.  I''d give it a 9 any day.  PTL</td>', 'I can''t tell if these hands belong to the head or belong to someone standing behind him.  Nice B&W.  Good focus, nice and soft.  Very good composition with good execution. The facial expression is almost non-expressive - very good for this shot.  I''d give it a 9 any day.  PTL', '2002-12-29 20:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(179295, 10079, 4648, '<td valign="top">I sure do hope you tell us what this is.  Can''t tell if it is the belly-button or not.  Or was it created when the scar was made.  The focus is so good I can see the dry skin under the kiss and around the button (?).  Not a bad shot, not a "wow" either, but technically ok.  I''d give it a 6.  PTL</td>', 'I sure do hope you tell us what this is.  Can''t tell if it is the belly-button or not.  Or was it created when the scar was made.  The focus is so good I can see the dry skin under the kiss and around the button (?).  Not a bad shot, not a "wow" either, but technically ok.  I''d give it a 6.  PTL', '2002-12-29 20:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(179296, 10014, 4648, '<td valign="top">What kid hasn''t made shadow puppets.  This is a very good puppet, as well as good photo.  Nice background.  It''s rather hard to make constructive comments when a photo is good, but not exciting.  This is good and technically fine.  It''s a 6 in my book.  PTL</td>', 'What kid hasn''t made shadow puppets.  This is a very good puppet, as well as good photo.  Nice background.  It''s rather hard to make constructive comments when a photo is good, but not exciting.  This is good and technically fine.  It''s a 6 in my book.  PTL', '2002-12-29 20:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(179297, 9880, 4648, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if you noticed but the lipstick has run off the lips onto the face on the left corner, down around to about the center.  This is very distracting with as dark and outstanding as the lipstick is.  Also the lips are not outlined evenly.  My understand of outlining is to even up the lips, or shape them.  But that''s my opinion.  Otherwise the photo is clear with good tones.  Just a little too bright with the lipstick.  But not bad photo.  It''s a 5 in my opinion.  PTL</td>', 'Don''t know if you noticed but the lipstick has run off the lips onto the face on the left corner, down around to about the center.  This is very distracting with as dark and outstanding as the lipstick is.  Also the lips are not outlined evenly.  My understand of outlining is to even up the lips, or shape them.  But that''s my opinion.  Otherwise the photo is clear with good tones.  Just a little too bright with the lipstick.  But not bad photo.  It''s a 5 in my opinion.  PTL', '2002-12-29 20:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(179298, 9834, 4648, '<td valign="top">I like how the feet are 3 different sizes and all held at a different angle.  This takes it from just a plain ole foot photo to an interesting photo of feet.  Make sense?  I especially like the little feet.  Nice B&amp;W.  Works well here for you.  I''d give it an 8 PTL</td>', 'I like how the feet are 3 different sizes and all held at a different angle.  This takes it from just a plain ole foot photo to an interesting photo of feet.  Make sense?  I especially like the little feet.  Nice B&W.  Works well here for you.  I''d give it an 8 PTL', '2002-12-29 21:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(179299, 9869, 4648, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to see that is the neck on the right side.  Hope they didn''t hurt theirself.  Biggest problem with this shot is focus, not enough of it.  It''s a good composition, B&amp;W works well.  Cropping is eye catching, but it needs focus badly.  I''d have to give it a 5 or less because of this.  PTL  And it''s a shame to hurt an otherwise really good photo.</td>', 'Took me a minute to see that is the neck on the right side.  Hope they didn''t hurt theirself.  Biggest problem with this shot is focus, not enough of it.  It''s a good composition, B&W works well.  Cropping is eye catching, but it needs focus badly.  I''d have to give it a 5 or less because of this.  PTL  And it''s a shame to hurt an otherwise really good photo.', '2002-12-29 21:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(179300, 9993, 4648, '<td valign="top">Tint seems to be a little off, a little too much yellow.  May be over compensation in the hue or saturation.  If not try these two things to change the tint.  Otherwise good photo.  PTL</td>', 'Tint seems to be a little off, a little too much yellow.  May be over compensation in the hue or saturation.  If not try these two things to change the tint.  Otherwise good photo.  PTL', '2002-12-29 21:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(179301, 10003, 4648, '<td valign="top">Too dark.  Otherwise good macro.  Good focus on the skin, to where can see every detail.  Nice shot, just lighten it up.  PTl</td>', 'Too dark.  Otherwise good macro.  Good focus on the skin, to where can see every detail.  Nice shot, just lighten it up.  PTl', '2002-12-29 21:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(179302, 10081, 4648, '<td valign="top">Boy scouts.  Too dark.  Shadow is very distracting.  I would be able to give this only a 2.  PTL</td>', 'Boy scouts.  Too dark.  Shadow is very distracting.  I would be able to give this only a 2.  PTL', '2002-12-29 21:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(179303, 10019, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Needs to be just a little lighter.  Good focus, cropping, composition.  Fingers just a little too red.  But basically a really nice shot.  Worth a 7.  PTL</td>', 'Nice shot.  Needs to be just a little lighter.  Good focus, cropping, composition.  Fingers just a little too red.  But basically a really nice shot.  Worth a 7.  PTL', '2002-12-29 21:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(179305, 9989, 4648, '<td valign="top">Appears grainy and out of focus.  Color is off.  Nice composition but needs better execution.  I''d give it a 3.  PTL</td>', 'Appears grainy and out of focus.  Color is off.  Nice composition but needs better execution.  I''d give it a 3.  PTL', '2002-12-29 21:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(179306, 10070, 4648, '<td valign="top">I would give this a 1.  PTL</td>', 'I would give this a 1.  PTL', '2002-12-29 21:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(179307, 9888, 4648, '<td valign="top">This would be a 1. PTL</td>', 'This would be a 1. PTL', '2002-12-29 21:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(179308, 10024, 4648, '<td valign="top">What a sweet family.  Somehow got the feet too light.  may was too dark and adjusted the gamma too much.  If that is the case works better to go one notch on gamma, then use either saturation or brightness to bring rest of the way.  That is if that was the problem.  Other wise it is a really good photo.  Good clear focus, nice cropping.  I like the 2 color border;  it works well with your colors.  This would be an 8 or 9 in my book.  PTL</td>', 'What a sweet family.  Somehow got the feet too light.  may was too dark and adjusted the gamma too much.  If that is the case works better to go one notch on gamma, then use either saturation or brightness to bring rest of the way.  That is if that was the problem.  Other wise it is a really good photo.  Good clear focus, nice cropping.  I like the 2 color border;  it works well with your colors.  This would be an 8 or 9 in my book.  PTL', '2002-12-29 21:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(179309, 9977, 4648, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo.  The tip of the cue stick is a little out of focus, but the rest is right on.  Biggest problem is the challenge is "body parts" and the hand is the lest thing in the photo.  The hand should be the focal point, not just stuck in on the side, occupying less than 1/10 of the photo.  Better photo than challenge meeting.  I hope you can understand what I mean.  For the challenge I''d have to give it a 4.  In another challenge it would be an 8 or 9.  PTL</td>', 'Really nice photo.  The tip of the cue stick is a little out of focus, but the rest is right on.  Biggest problem is the challenge is "body parts" and the hand is the lest thing in the photo.  The hand should be the focal point, not just stuck in on the side, occupying less than 1/10 of the photo.  Better photo than challenge meeting.  I hope you can understand what I mean.  For the challenge I''d have to give it a 4.  In another challenge it would be an 8 or 9.  PTL', '2002-12-29 21:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(179310, 10035, 4648, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  I really like the old bathroom.  Is this in a home or apartment?  Back to the photo.   This is different and I like it.  Could stand to be a little lighter, but not too much or you''ll blow out the wall, tube, and curtain.  But does need to be brighter.  Otherwise it rates an 8.  PTL</td>', 'Interesting photo.  I really like the old bathroom.  Is this in a home or apartment?  Back to the photo.   This is different and I like it.  Could stand to be a little lighter, but not too much or you''ll blow out the wall, tube, and curtain.  But does need to be brighter.  Otherwise it rates an 8.  PTL', '2002-12-29 21:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(179313, 10082, 4648, '<td valign="top">My reaction exactly, followed by reversing the parastolisysis.  This turns my stomach, which might be the reaction you were reaching for.  As far as the photo for photography sake goes - the focus is good;  cropping is a little tight, you should have shown all of the mouth and mustasche and nose since you showed the chin; coloring - i''ve never seen a tongue that red unless they''ve eaten a cherry popsicle.  For the challenge I guess it would probably be a 7 by someone else, but by me it would only be a 5.  Then I''d go clean up the mess I made.  PTL</td>', 'My reaction exactly, followed by reversing the parastolisysis.  This turns my stomach, which might be the reaction you were reaching for.  As far as the photo for photography sake goes - the focus is good;  cropping is a little tight, you should have shown all of the mouth and mustasche and nose since you showed the chin; coloring - i''ve never seen a tongue that red unless they''ve eaten a cherry popsicle.  For the challenge I guess it would probably be a 7 by someone else, but by me it would only be a 5.  Then I''d go clean up the mess I made.  PTL', '2002-12-29 21:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(179314, 9950, 4648, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W works well here.  Only problem I see is you lose your focus on the handd about the end of the thumb.  I feel it should be in good focus all the way.  Since the bottle is in good focus I''d think this was caused by cropping.  Try zooming in closer then when you crop it will be in focus.  Just a thought.  It''s still a good 6.  PTL</td>', 'B&W works well here.  Only problem I see is you lose your focus on the handd about the end of the thumb.  I feel it should be in good focus all the way.  Since the bottle is in good focus I''d think this was caused by cropping.  Try zooming in closer then when you crop it will be in focus.  Just a thought.  It''s still a good 6.  PTL', '2002-12-29 21:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(179317, 10082, 2649, '<td valign="top">Technically very good, but ugly.</td>', 'Technically very good, but ugly.', '2002-12-29 21:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(179319, 10068, 2649, '<td valign="top">On my screen the photo seems under exposed.</td>', 'On my screen the photo seems under exposed.', '2002-12-29 21:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(179321, 9907, 4648, '<td valign="top">I hope you explain this one to us.  Is this the way the back of a geisha girl looks?  The photo is good technically, focus, cropping, framing, etc.  I just don''t understand what you are saying.  Therefore I couldn''t score it higher than 5.  PTL</td>', 'I hope you explain this one to us.  Is this the way the back of a geisha girl looks?  The photo is good technically, focus, cropping, framing, etc.  I just don''t understand what you are saying.  Therefore I couldn''t score it higher than 5.  PTL', '2002-12-29 21:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(179322, 9844, 4648, '<td valign="top">Am I seeing things or is your frame thicker on the left bottom than the right bottom, and on the left side more than the right side?  It''s a very good shadow dog.  You should have left the bird or duck out.  Also I don''t believe you meet the challenge because you didn''t show the body part you are making the dog with.  I know we all know, but the photo should show it.  SO.....I couldn''t score you more than a 3.  It''s also too dark for my likes.  PTL</td>', 'Am I seeing things or is your frame thicker on the left bottom than the right bottom, and on the left side more than the right side?  It''s a very good shadow dog.  You should have left the bird or duck out.  Also I don''t believe you meet the challenge because you didn''t show the body part you are making the dog with.  I know we all know, but the photo should show it.  SO.....I couldn''t score you more than a 3.  It''s also too dark for my likes.  PTL', '2002-12-29 21:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(179323, 10061, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice rose.  The colors are a little faded.  Too much shadow on the right side, or not enough, depending on what your intention was.  The focus is good and the composition is ok, just need better execution.  This would be about a 5.  PTL</td>', 'Nice rose.  The colors are a little faded.  Too much shadow on the right side, or not enough, depending on what your intention was.  The focus is good and the composition is ok, just need better execution.  This would be about a 5.  PTL', '2002-12-29 21:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(179325, 9997, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent image... the black and white works extremely well here... good work :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent image... the black and white works extremely well here... good work :) - setzler', '2002-12-29 22:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(179348, 9890, 843, '<td valign="top">I love the idea and the execution. Might have been nice to see the thumb.</td>', 'I love the idea and the execution. Might have been nice to see the thumb.', '2002-12-29 23:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
