(179601, 9997, 472, '<td valign="top">thanks for comments.  i was going to call it weathered hands but at the last moment it seemed to be prying open the screen.  <br/> <br/>btw, those are my own rough and rugged masculine hands ; ) ..</td>', 'thanks for comments.  i was going to call it weathered hands but at the last moment it seemed to be prying open the screen.   btw, those are my own rough and rugged masculine hands ; ) ..', '2002-12-30 07:52:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(179674, 10070, 1779, '<td valign="top">qué bonito... nosotros acá trabajando y tú, de lo lindo... con el pretexto de que es arte, te das esos sutiles gustos... maldito.<br/> <br/>ora sí, de la foto:<br/> <br/>nos gustó mucho, salvo por el imperdonable closet de atrás (dice roberto q está peor q su pato cortado de la cabeza).<br/> <br/>saludos,<br/> <br/>LM<br/> <br/> <br/>PD: I''m back en blanco y negro....</td>', 'qué bonito... nosotros acá trabajando y tú, de lo lindo... con el pretexto de que es arte, te das esos sutiles gustos... maldito. ora sí, de la foto: nos gustó mucho, salvo por el imperdonable closet de atrás (dice roberto q está peor q su pato cortado de la cabeza). saludos, LM  PD: I''m back en blanco y negro....', '2002-12-30 11:10:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(179679, 9982, 3575, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Carsten! This is a well deserved win, so beautifully shot and wonderful idea. I look forward to your future entries!</td>', 'Congratulations Carsten! This is a well deserved win, so beautifully shot and wonderful idea. I look forward to your future entries!', '2002-12-30 11:18:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(179683, 9950, 5436, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by justine:</b></div><hr/><i>I like your composition, and the tones. The focus is terrible........but you know I think it''s your compression. If I''m wrong correct me, but the software you used has hurt this neat shot. Still I give you a 7 it''s good work.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ya This shot was actually in focus. Somehow by the time I cropped it and submitted it, it had blurred so bad it looks out of focus. Thanks for the comments!</td>', 'Originally posted by justine:I like your composition, and the tones. The focus is terrible........but you know I think it''s your compression. If I''m wrong correct me, but the software you used has hurt this neat shot. Still I give you a 7 it''s good work.  Ya This shot was actually in focus. Somehow by the time I cropped it and submitted it, it had blurred so bad it looks out of focus. Thanks for the comments!', '2002-12-30 11:28:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(179691, 9982, 714, '<td valign="top">Congrats.  Very original shot.</td>', 'Congrats.  Very original shot.', '2002-12-30 11:47:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(179697, 9911, 714, '<td valign="top">I seen this shot and thought for sure this would get 1st,  Great b/w.  Love the pose. Congrats on second.</td>', 'I seen this shot and thought for sure this would get 1st,  Great b/w.  Love the pose. Congrats on second.', '2002-12-30 11:50:29.000000', NULL, 0),
